o leaves, and the edges of his hat. In the deep background, distant fog-shrouded mountain silhouettes dissolve into ink-wash gradients. Desaturated slate and cool moon-white palette with warm gold scroll glow accents, photorealistic PBR detail, ink-wash undertone, cinematic lighting, romantic jianghu atmosphere."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1523, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 1684, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [480, 270], "pos": [13812.517578125, -54.46307373046875], "id": 942, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 23}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1717], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [404.49615478515625, 110.81554412841797], "pos": [13847.7099609375, -435.0733337402344], "widgets_values": [504, 504, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "批次大小"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1044, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [1693], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#346434", "widgets_values": ["我要生成游戏图标。\n这个游戏图标的美术风格是：\n高品质日系二次元手游幻想装备原画，参考《原神